rule: TEST_DISABLED
title: the same line under a version gate is a compat gate, not a kill
origin: attrs 61e8179545 in the FP corpus — `collect_ignore.extend([...])`
origin2: under `if not PY_3_14_PLUS`, shipped with the production change that
origin3: made the new tests possible. The constant is imported from a file the
origin4: diff never touches, so it is resolved from the head snapshot.
=== head: src/app/_compat.py ===
import sys

PY_3_14_PLUS = sys.version_info[:2] >= (3, 14)
=== before: tests/conftest.py ===
